*4 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Vermilingua Rangmaster]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.
**50 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
**12 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**6 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You will likely have a good amount of money in this stage thanks to the amount of peons, making affording your units easier. With this consideration in mind, [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] can be spammed easily. Courier can constantly hit a lot of peons and juggle Gories, and while Octopus Cat is likely to die quickly, it has meaningful impact for every Wave it stops, preventing damage to your backlines. [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] are effective in general.

